%% M2 in-call conversation (Pipecat + policy unchanged from M1)
%% never Speak agent audio before AI disclosure opener
%% never Store recording without consent
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PolicyCheck: m2-test-call / place_call
  PolicyCheck --> Rejected: policy fail
  PolicyCheck --> Dialing: policy ok
  Rejected --> [*]
  Dialing --> Ringing: ARI originate
  Ringing --> Finalized: no_answer / busy / line_unavailable
  Ringing --> Answered: callee picks up
  Answered --> OpenDisclosure: bridge WebSocket / Pipecat
  OpenDisclosure --> Listening: opener played
  Listening --> UserSpeaking: VAD speech
  UserSpeaking --> Transcribing: VAD end (~300-500ms)
  Transcribing --> Thinking: STT final (DE)
  Thinking --> Speaking: LLM stream + TTS (REST default)
  Speaking --> Listening: turn complete
  Speaking --> UserSpeaking: barge-in (cancel TTS/LLM)
  Thinking --> Filler: LLM > 1.2s
  Filler --> Speaking: filler TTS then resume
  Listening --> SilenceTimeout: 20s no speech
  Speaking --> ToolDtmf: send_dtmf
  ToolDtmf --> Listening
  Speaking --> HangupAgent: end_call tool
  Answered --> MaxDuration: timer
  SilenceTimeout --> HangupAgent
  MaxDuration --> HangupAgent
  HangupAgent --> Finalized: summary path (M4)
  Finalized --> [*]
